#NEXUS
[Gavryushkina et al. 2017 penguin morphology: the 202 characters analysed (of 245 in the BEAST2 XML 8+dna_R.xml; the other 43 are constant once outgroups are removed). CHARSETs give the number of states assumed for each Mkv partition. All characters unordered.]

